# The keys scripts/gates.conf may set (one per line; `#` comments). Read by the package's own reader (core/gates-conf.sh) and by vbm-land's drift check (land-check):
# AN UNKNOWN KEY FAILS, so a typo cannot silently switch a gate off. Values are data (nothing is expanded or run); a path list is space-separated plain repository paths.
# This file is append-only: a new key is a new line in a new release.
#
# The gate-diff judge's tables (core/gate-diff-improving.sh):
GATES_TIER1
GATES_STRICT
GATES_LISTS
GATES_SOURCE
GATES_SOURCE_DIRS
GATES_APPROVABLE
GATES_RULES_FILE
GATES_PROTECTED_LIST
#
# The lander hooks (hooks/):
GATES_WARM_DIRS
